{
  "title": "Keto-friendly Bhuna Flaky Banana Crumble",
  "description": "A fermented, flaky Venezuelan dish featuring keto-friendly fried ripe bananas with a bhuna sauce crumble topping.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
